  "notes": "Taiwan press register, matched without word boundaries, so every entry is a 3-to-5 character compound and no bare two-character morpheme survives. Deliberately dropped: 補貼, 關稅, 減稅, 加稅, 調降, 調漲, 凍漲, 禁令, 配額, 通過, 公告, 法案, 條例, 辦法, 措施, 規定, 命令, 執照, 補助, 發放 as standalone terms — each is a substring of ordinary prose (e.g. 通過 'to pass by', 措施/規定 in any corporate story) and would flood the gate. Instead each appears only inside a verb+object or modifier compound (調降稅率, 三讀通過, 政府公告, 管理辦法). Also dropped 記者會 and anything embedded in it. Subject nouns (油價, 汽油, 能源, 米價, 糧食) are excluded so the two-signal design holds; 貨物稅 and 價格 are kept because they name the instrument, not the commodity."
